    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"tutorial3","source":"You've received a gift! Tap on the package to open it.","translation":"你收到了一份禮物！點一下包裹將它打開。"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"tutorial5","source":"Tap the Close button when you're done with the Journal.","translation":"看完日誌後，點一下關閉按鈕。"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"tutorial6","source":"Looks like quite a mess! Let's clear this place up.","translation":"這裡看起來真亂！來把它清理乾淨吧。"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"tutorial7","source":"Tap on a weed to clear it.","translation":"點一下雜草將它清除。"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"tutorial8","source":"Well done! Try clearing some more weeds and rocks.","translation":"做得好！再試著清除一些雜草和石頭。"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"tutorial9","source":"You can use the hoe to prepare the soil for planting.","translation":"你可以用鋤頭整理土壤，準備種植。"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"tutorial10","source":"Try preparing a garden patch to sow your first seeds.","translation":"試著整理一小塊田地，播下第一批種子。"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"tutorial11","source":"Great work... time to add some seeds.","translation":"做得很好……該播種了。"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"tutorial12","source":"They look thirsty - there's a watering can in the toolbar.","translation":"它們看起來很渴，工具列裡有一把澆水壺。"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"tutorial13","source":"Well done! Remember to water your crops every day.","translation":"做得好！記得每天替作物澆水。"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"tutorial15","source":"You can fill your watering can at a pond or river.","translation":"你可以在池塘或河流旁裝滿澆水壺。"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"tutorial16","source":"Tap and hold to walk toward your finger.","translation":"點住畫面，角色就會朝手指方向行走。"},
